  "metadata": {
    "name": "Flade Isblink ice cap cryoconite and sediment radionuclide measurements",
    "description": "Dataset containing 48 samples collected from the Flade Isblink ice cap in northeastern Greenland during August 2022. The samples include cryoconite (46 samples) and river sediment (2 samples, one glacial and one non-glacial). Measurements include concentrations of radionuclides (137Cs, 210Pb, 214Pb, 241Am, 207Bi, 228Ac, 7Be, 40K, 238Pu, 239+240Pu) with associated uncertainties, loss on ignition (LOI), carbon content, and plutonium isotope ratios (238/239+240Pu atom ratio and 240Pu/239Pu atom ratio). Samples were collected at the ice surface (depth 0) with GPS coordinates and elevation recorded.",
